  "title": "Holiday Buffet Meatballs",
  "description": "I received this recipe from a dear neighbor many years ago. The meatballs are very good and easy to make and the sauce ingredients are items that you would normally have on hand. If you have the meatballs, you can whip up this appetizer in a snap.",
  "authors": [
